<title>USA: TABLE - Tseng Labs Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Tseng Labs Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,		June 30,</p>
<p>				    1997	1996	1997     1996</p>
<p> Sales			  $ 2,461  $ 6,744   $ 5,061 $ 10,851</p>
<p> Cost of sales		  1,907    5,515     3,845    9,345</p>
<p> Gross profit		     554    1,229     1,216    1,506</p>
<p> Research and development   2,358    1,193     4,715    2,480</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>  Administrative		1,272    1,989     2,642    3,614</p>
<p>  Operating Loss	    (3,076)  (1,953)   (6,141)  (4,588)</p>
<p> Interest Income		  468	367	 837	821</p>
<p>Loss Before Income Taxes</p>
<p>				  (2,608)  (1,586)   (5,304)  (3,767)</p>
<p> Income Taxes (Benefit)     (913)    (555)   (1,857)  (1,319)</p>
<p> Net Loss		     (1,695)  (1,031)   (3,447)  (2,448)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share	  (0.09)   (0.05)    (0.18)   (0.13)</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number</p>
<p>   of Shares Outstanding   19,062   18,988    19,074   18,978</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the decrease in Q2 1997 revenues resulted from lower unit shipments of graphic products and solution pricing pressures.</p>
<p>Tseng Laboratories Inc.</p>
</text>
